   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Gràcies Tim,<div><br></div><div>Ens veiem dijous!!!</div><div><br></div><div>Lluís Ramon<br>\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2011/12/12 Tim Riffe <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tim....@googlemail.com</a>&gt;</span></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\nSi, perdona: Acabo de preguntar a Maik:<div>La reunió estarà a la Sala Charles Darwin. Es pot entrar directament des de la plaça central sense entrar al PRBB. És a l&#39;esquerra dels arbres a la plaça central quan estás mirant cap a la platge (tampoc sé exactament que imaginar, però deu der fàcil). També qui vol sortir després, poden anar al Born per exemple.</div>\n\n\n<div>Fins el dijous!</div><div>Tim<br><div><div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2011/12/12 Aleix Ruiz De Villa <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">alei...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\n\n<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><div>Tim, a quina aula del prbb?<br><br>Aleix</div><div><br>El 12/12/2011, a las 20:01, Tim Riffe &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tim....@googlemail.com</a>&gt; escribió:<br>\n\n\n<br></div><div><div><div></div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br><div><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"8\" border=\"0\" summary=\"\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Sans-serif;border:1px Solid #ccc;border-width:1px 2px 2px 1px;background-color:#fff\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n\n<td><div style=\"padding:2px\"><div style=\"float:right;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px\"> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=VIEW&amp;eid=Njc2cHNmdTQ2YWhlcmU1cmZsNGxwZ2x2NW8gcnVnYmNuQG0&amp;tok=MTYjcnVnYmNuQGdtYWlsLmNvbTViYmU3MDY2NzRhYjk2YjBlNDgzZTFhMjFiZTI4MDE3M2VlNzM1MjM&amp;ctz=Atlantic%2FCanary&amp;hl=es\" style=\"color:#20c;white-space:nowrap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action%3DVIEW%26eid%3DNjc2cHNmdTQ2YWhlcmU1cmZsNGxwZ2x2NW8gcnVnYmNuQG0%26tok%3DMTYjcnVnYmNuQGdtYWlsLmNvbTViYmU3MDY2NzRhYjk2YjBlNDgzZTFhMjFiZTI4MDE3M2VlNzM1MjM%26ctz%3DAtlantic%252FCanary%26hl%3Des&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243043705000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03VMcaplEkq_YMxOhg4pLO\">más detalles »</a><br>\n\n\n\n\n</div><h3 style=\"padding:0 0 6px 0;margin:0;font-family:Arial,Sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#222\">Reunió al PRBB: 2 xerrades // Meeting at the PRBB, 2 talks</h3><div style=\"padding-bottom:15px;font-size:13px;color:#222;white-space:pre-wrap!important;white-space:-moz-pre-wrap!important;white-space:-pre-wrap!important;white-space:-o-pre-wrap!important;white-space:pre-wrap;word-wrap:break-word\">\n\n\n\n\ntenim 2 presentacions planificats (en anglès aquesta vegada):<br>1) introdució al ggplot2- Maik Röder<br>2) Reference Classes - Aleix Ruiz de Villa<br>cada presentació durarà uns 30 minuts amb 15 minuts de discussió.<p>The following two talks about R have been scheduled:<br>\n\n\n\n\n1. Introduction to ggplot2 - Maik Röder<br>2. Reference Classes - Aleix Ruiz de Villa<br>Each talk will take around 30 minutes with 15 minutes discussion each.</p></div><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" summary=\"Información del evento\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0 1em 10px 0;font-family:Arial,Sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#888;white-space:nowrap\" valign=\"top\"><div><i style=\"font-style:normal\">Cuándo</i></div></td><td style=\"padding-bottom:10px;font-family:Arial,Sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#222\" valign=\"top\">\n\n\n\n\njue 15 de dic 19:00 – 20:30 <span style=\"color:#888\">Islas Canarias</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 1em 10px 0;font-family:Arial,Sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#888;white-space:nowrap\" valign=\"top\"><div><i style=\"font-style:normal\">Dónde</i></div>\n\n\n\n\n</td><td style=\"padding-bottom:10px;font-family:Arial,Sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#222\" valign=\"top\">PRBB<span dir=\"ltr\"> (<a href=\"http://maps.google.es/maps?q=PRBB&amp;hl=es\" style=\"color:#20c;white-space:nowrap\" targ